","heading":"2026: the dart side 🛸💍","text":"Through 4 games under Anargha, the dart side 🛸💍 are 1-3 and 6th in the standings, with 560.62 points (4th). [[p:6813|Jonathan Taylor]] led the club with 94.80 points in 4 starts, followed by [[p:3294|Dak Prescott]] (82.40). The season high was 162.10 in week 4 ([[g:2026-04-6-7]]). The front office made 16 transactions, 1 of them trades. The club was renamed 2 times during the year, ending as the dart side 🛸💍."}]}